:: basement
<<scenery basement>>
You are currently in your basement.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <div class="row">\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<if $slaves.length > 0>>\
                Slaves:
                <<set _slaveIndex to 0>>\
                <<for _slave range $slaves>>\
                    <<print "<<link '_slave.name (_slave.age y.o. _slave.hairColor hair)'>><<set $npc to " + JSON.stringify(_slave) + ", $npc.index to " + _slaveIndex + ">><<openNpcInteraction slave>><</link>>">>
                    <<set _slaveIndex++>>\
                <</for>>\
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<set _avaliableBeds to Basement.avaliableBeds()>>
            <<if _avaliableBeds <= 0>>\
                There's no more room for more slaves. You need to buy matresses if you want more.
            <<else>>\
                There's room for <<- _avaliableBeds>> more slave<<if _avaliableBeds gt 1>>s<</if>>.
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
    </div>


    <<keyOption "Go back upstairs" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\
:: slaveApproach
You approach $npc.name.
<<include npcStats>>
<<if $npc.fear gt 90>>\
    $npc.genPronoun walks back scared and wodering what you will do to $npc.pronoun.
<<elseif $npc.gender == 'male' && $npc.lust gte 30>>\
    <<set $npc.honry = true>>\
    He looks at you with expectancy. <<if $npc.haveClothes>>@@color:pink;You can see a bump on his pants@@<<else>>@@color:deeppink;He's already erected@@ ❤<</if>>.
<<elseif $npc.lust gte 50>>
    <<set $npc.honry = true>>\
    She looks at you with expectancy. <<if !$npc.haveClothes>>@@color:deeppink;Her pussy is wet and leaking@@ ❤<</if>>.
<<else>>\
    $npc.genPronoun nervously looks at you with $npc.possessive $npc.eyeColor eyes.
<</if>>